sequenceDiagram
    participant Push as PushSyncWorker (Ch 49)
    participant Inbox as InboxRepository (Room, Ch 3)
    participant Notif as Notifier
    participant Sys as System drawer
    actor User
    participant Nav as App (deep link, Ch 52)

    Push->>Inbox: upsert InboxItem (durable record)
    Push->>Notif: notifyFor(item) if permitted (Ch 51)
    Notif->>Sys: post (channel, style, group, deep-link PendingIntent)
    User->>Sys: tap notification
    Sys->>Nav: deep link -> order screen (Ch 52)
    Nav->>Inbox: markRead(id)  (local + sync up, Ch 32)
    Nav->>Notif: cancel(id)    (remove from drawer)
